<title>USA: Wolohan Lumber Co Q3 Sept 28 net rises.</title>
<headline>Wolohan Lumber Co Q3 Sept 28 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SAGINAW, Mich. 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sep 28,	    Sep 30,</p>
<p> FOR THE THREE MONTHS ENDED	    1996		 1995</p>
<p> Sales				$132,850,000     $122,638,000</p>
<p> Net income			    3,486,000	  1,561,000</p>
<p> Per share				     .50		  .22</p>
<p>					     Sep 28,	    Sep 30,</p>
<p> FOR THE NINE MONTHS ENDED	     1996		 1995</p>
<p> Sales				 325,496,000	321,144,000</p>
<p> Net income			    5,012,000	  3,677,000</p>
<p> Per share				     .72		  .52</p>
<p>NOTES - Store closing costs in Q3 reduced earnings by $0.04/shr in '96 and $0.17/shr in '95.</p>
</text>
